<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 17:30:20 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>好朋友最棒</title><link>https://some.pics/6a63a127c0631</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🥰 好朋友是最棒的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="🥰 Goei vrienden zijn de max. " height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a63a127c0631.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 17:30:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>章鱼流体月影幻境</title><link>https://some.pics/6a639dd6c962d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;章鱼流体月球幻影&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Fountain pen ink swatch of Octopus Fluids Lunar Mirage, a purplish grey with green shimmer" height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/cygnoir/6a639dd6c962d.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://cygnoir.some.pics"&gt;@cygnoir&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 17:16:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a63919a95a96</link><description>&lt;p&gt;迷离时空的氛围。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Looking up at an old brick building where a mannequin with short red hair is staring out the window. The building comprises many textures, colors, and materials, with some painted window frames, ornamental columns, and boarded up windows." height="1704" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/markwyner/6a63919a95a96.jpg" width="2272"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://markwyner.some.pics"&gt;@markwyner&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 16:23:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a639052698a0</link><description>&lt;p&gt;门开着，眼前的空荡引起了我的注意。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Looking into a old hotel room with a recently-slept-in bed that has a simple, black, metal frame.  Aside from the bed there is only a nightstand with a lamp on it, a dresser, and a single framed photo on the wall. Everything looks early 20th century, including the ornamental carpet and simple curtains that are scarcely protecting the room from the bright sun." height="1704" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/markwyner/6a639052698a0.jpg" width="2272"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://markwyner.some.pics"&gt;@markwyner&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 16:18:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a638daba6cb8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;#星期五窗户&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A four-storey office block with large windows in which white and grey clouds are reflected. On the left-hand side, a metal spiral emergency- staircase winds its way up. The building has a triangular roof terrace, above which a triangular roof juts out. Tall trees stand next to the building, and there is a car park in front of it. The picture is in black and white." height="2908" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a638daba6cb8.jpg" width="2342"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 16:07:10 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>